    rdfs1:comment "Yvan Stringer is a professor emeritus of Economics at HEC Montreal, retired since 2005. He holds a L.Sc.comm, D.E.S. in Applied Economics from HEC Montreal and a Ph.D. in Economics from York University. Professor Stringer was the Director of the Institute of Applied Economics at HEC Montreal. He was also business manager of L'Actualité économique at HEC Montreal."@en ;
    rdfs1:label "Yvan Stringer"@en ;
