dbpedia:Alex_Rossi_\(journalist\) dbo:abstract "Alex Rossi is Asia Correspondent of Sky News, the 24_hour television news service operated by Sky Television, part of British Sky Broadcasting. Born about 1978_79, he is from Salisbury, Wiltshire and is based in Delhi in India, reporting on news stories across the Southern Asia region, including Pakistan and Afghanistan. He was formerly Sky News Europe Correspondent, based in Brussels and Russia Correspondent, based in Moscow. He became Asia Correspondent in 2011."@en ;
