dbpedia:Carlos_Francisco_Martins_Pinheiro dbo:abstract "Carlos Francisco Martins Pinheiro (* 30. Mai 1925 in Vila Praia de Âncora, Portugal; † 4. Juni 2010 ebenda) war Weihbischof im Erzbistum Braga."@de,
        "Carlos Francisco Martins Pinheiro (May 30, 1925 – June 4, 2010) was the Roman Catholic titular bishop of Dumium and the auxiliary bishop of the Roman Catholic Archdiocese of Braga, Portugal. Ordained to the priesthood on July 8, 1951, Pinheiro was named auxiliary bishop of the Braga Archdiocese on February 16, 1985 and was ordained bishop on April 28, 1985 retiring on November 10, 2000."@en,
        "Carlos Francisco Martins Pinheiro (Vila Praia de Âncora, Caminha, 30 de maio de 1925 — 4 de Junho 2010) foi Bispo_auxiliar de Braga."@pt ;
