dbpedia:Chip_Le_Grand dbo:abstract "Chip Le Grand (born Blacksburg, Virginia USA) is an Australian sports journalist. He lives in Melbourne, Australia and writes for nationwide newspaper The Australian, primarily on sports articles. His writing was included in an anthology of sports newspaper writing, The best Australian sports writing, 2002. He has, in 2004 and early 2005, appeared on Mark Doran's show \"The Nightwatchmen\" on SEN 1116 with a roundup of the day's sporting articles. He is currently The Australian's Victorian editor."@en ;
