dbpedia:Tony_Maher_\(Gaelic_footballer\) dbo:abstract "Tony Maher is a former Gaelic footballer from County Laois. He played for Laois senior football team, primarily in midfield, throughout the 1990s and into the early 2000s. In 1991, he played on the Laois team beaten by Meath in the final of the Leinster Senior Football Championship. He was appointed as manager of the Timahoe senior football team in late 2007."@en ;
