ns1:silverbells dct:description """Peter Paul Pigmans (aka 3 Steps Ahead), one of the biggest and well known names in the hardcore scene. He started together with Rob Fabrie (aka DJ Waxweazle) and formed 3 Steps Ahead. Later he also produced records under The Illegal Alien and The Ender. The latter was named after his son Ender Pigmans. Peter Paul died on the 27th of august 2003, after fighting against cancer for 4 Years. In July 2003 there was a benefit party for Peter Paul but it was allready too late. 

R.I.P. Peter Paul Pigmans 31_01_1961 / 27_08_2003
""" ;
    mo:discogs ns24:Silverbells ;
    rdf1:type mo:MusicArtist ;
    foaf:depiction <http://api.discogs.com/image/A_102393_1126005156.jpeg> ;
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <http://www.3stepsahead.nl> ;
    foaf:made <http://data.kasabi.com/dataset/discogs/release/136464/track/12>,
        <http://data.kasabi.com/dataset/discogs/release/158189/track/10>,
        ns22:b4,
        ns23:b3 ;
    foaf:name "Peter Paul Pigmans",
        "Silverbells" .

ns20:moodclub_music ns21:contactInformation "pietervanderbeeken@gmail.com" ;
    dct:description "After many years of organising quality electronic music events in the Belgian nightlife, Moodclub's Pierre De La Rivière and Gratts figured the time had come to take their love for music a step further. The result: the recently born Moodclub Music imprint, a digital label on which they will be and have been releasing music for the people, by the people. Ranging from deeper house affairs to more uptempo jams, simply anything goes, as long as it's quality  electronic dance music. House music, as we would probably call it." ;
    dct:isPartOf ns20:bokal_records ;
    mo:discogs <http://www.discogs.com/label/Moodclub+Music> ;
    rdf1:type mo:Label ;
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf ns19:moodclubmusic ;
    foaf:logo <http://api.discogs.com/image/L_119121_1216725423.jpeg>,
        <http://api.discogs.com/image/L_119121_1234247772.png> ;
    foaf:name "Moodclub Music" .

ns20:nexgen_records ns21:contactInformation "NEXGEN MUSIC GROUP 170 Kent Street, Suite 1 Brooklyn, NY 11222 +1 (718) 844_0172 demos (at) nexgenmusicgroup.com AIM: N3xG3n1 " ;
    dct:description """NexGen Music promises to deliver you deep into the four Human Intelligences; Mental (IQ), Emotional (EQ), Spiritual (SQ) & Physical (PQ).  NexGen is about love, creativity and freedom of the musical soul.

***

NexGen Music is a well_established worldwide independent music label known for it’s innovative approach to the fusion of live, vocal and electronic music. Covering at least 10 sub_genres of mainstream and underground music. NexGen are the masters of blending a raw mixture of talented musicians with top_quality producers and engineers.

NexGen’s modus operandi is a dedication to the creation of barrier_breaking musical compositions, while also offering new ‘comfort_zones’ to listeners not typically familiar with electronic music. The sexy fusion of live and session musicians creating Down_tempo, Soul, Funk, Chill_out, Nu_Jazz, Experimental, Dub and Drum & Bass music styles, NexGen describes all it’s works in totality as ‘Sophisticated Soul’.

NexGen Music has also gained extensive international exposure for their music featured in major and independent film soundtracks in the US, UK & Europe, as well as the consistently positive plays and reviews by top media outlets, including worldwide radio play from top DJ's on internet, FM and satellite radio.
""" ;
    dct:isPartOf ns20:nexgen_music ;
    mo:discogs <http://www.discogs.com/label/Nexgen+Records> ;
    rdf1:type mo:Label ;
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf ns19:nexgenrecords,
        <http://www.nexgenrecs.com>,
        ns26:nexgenrecs,
        ns27:nexgenmusic ;
    foaf:logo <http://api.discogs.com/image/L_90247_1266507330.jpeg> ;
    foaf:name "Nexgen Records" .

ns20:toxicated_beats_recordings dct:description "Toxicated Beats Recordings is a label based in Prishtina. Set up in 2008 by Vegim aka Toxic Therapy. The goal of the label is to discover a new artists and to give opportunity to them to release their tracks. In 2008, the Label plans on growing and expanding operations, fluently going beside new trend of techno and minimal alongside with some toxicated sound that will make you swet." ;
    mo:discogs <http://www.discogs.com/label/Toxicated+Beats+Recordings> ;
    rdf1:type mo:Label ;
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf ns19:toxicatedbeats ;
    foaf:name "Toxicated Beats Recordings" .

