    dbo:abstract "Christophe Maraninchi (born February 17, 1983 in Toulon) is a French professional football player. Currently, he plays in the Championnat National for Hyères FC. He played on the professional level in Swiss Super League for Neuchâtel Xamax. He also played with Xamax in the 2005 UEFA Intertoto Cup, scoring one goal against FC Ararat Yerevan and one against AS Saint_Étienne."@en,
