dbpedia:Don_W._Fawcett dbo:abstract "Don Wayne Fawcett (* 14. März 1917 in Springdale, Iowa; † 7. Mai 2009 in Missoula, Montana) war ein US_amerikanischer Anatom und Zellbiologe."@de,
        "Don Wayne Fawcett (1917 _ May 7, 2009) was a pioneer of electron microscopy and one of its greatest practitioners for studying the organization of cells and tissues. His greatest achievement was his description of the structure of spermatozoa and the male reproductive system."@en ;
