<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Eberwin_III,_Count_of_Bentheim_Steinfurt> dbo:abstract "Eberwin III. von Bentheim_Steinfurt (* 1536; † 19. Februar 1562 auf Burg Bentheim) war ab 1544 Graf von Bentheim und Steinfurt aus dem Haus Bentheim_Steinfurt und durch Ehe ab 1557 Graf von Tecklenburg sowie Herr von Rheda."@de,
        "Eberwin III, Count of Bentheim_Steinfurt (1536 – 19 February 1562 at Bentheim Castle) was a German nobleman. He was a member of the elder line of the House of Bentheim_Steinfurt and was the ruling Count of Bentheim and Steinfurt from 1544 until his death. From 1557, he was also Count of Tecklenburg and Lord of Rheda by marriage."@en ;
