    dbo:abstract "Christophe Martin (born 21 February 1975 in Tournai) is a Belgian football goalkeeper who currently plays for R.F.C. Tournai. He started Mouscron's first four league matches of the 2006_07 season, but was back on the bench after their 3_1 defeat to K.S.K. Beveren on 26 August 2006."@en,
        "Christophe Martin est un footballeur belge né le 21 février 1975 à Tournai. Il évolue au poste de gardien de but."@fr,
