dbpedia:Joe_Menzies dbo:abstract "Arthur Briton \"Joe\" Menzies (13 May 1892 – 31 October 1960) was a New Zealand professional rugby league footballer of the 1920s, playing at representative level for New Zealand (#187), and Waikato, as a Prop, i.e. number 8 or 10, during the era of contested scrums. Menzies played for the Ngaruawahia Panthers."@en ;
