dbpedia:James_Danky dbo:abstract "James Danky (born 1947) is an American historian, bibliographer, and culture critic. He is currently a faculty associate at the University of Wisconsin_Madison School of Journalism and Mass Communication. Danky is best known as an advocate for collecting alternative and small_press publications during his tenure at the Wisconsin Historical Society."@en ;
