dbpedia:Maud_Kaptheijns dbo:abstract "Maud Kaptheijns (born 28 September 1994) is a Dutch female cyclo_cross cyclist. She won the gold medal in the under_23 event at the 2015 European Cyclo_cross Championships after eventual winner Femke Van den Driessche was disqualified. She also won the bronze medal in the women's under_23 event at the 2016 UCI Cyclo_cross World Championships  in Heusden_Zolder."@en ;
