<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Anatole,_baron_Brénier_de_Renaudière> dbo:abstract "Anatole Alexandre François Henri Baron Brenier de Renaudière (22 August 1807, Paris – 27 March 1885 Lucassière Vouvray (Indre_et_Loire)) was a French diplomat and politician. He was minister of France to Naples.He was Foreign Minister from 24 January to 10 April 1851 and then became a senator on 24 May 1861. He married Isabelle Unwina Hely Hutchison."@en,
