dbpedia:Jirachai_Linglom dbo:abstract "Jirachai Linglom (born 13 October 1978 in Thailand) is a Thai sprinter who competed in the 2000 Summer Olympics and other prestigious track and field competitions. Linglom's two main events are the 400 metre hurdles and the 4 x 400 metre relay."@en ;
