        "Oliver Roggisch (born August 25, 1978 in Villingen_Schwenningen) is a retired German team handball player who played for Rhein_Neckar Löwen.He has joined the coaching staff at his club as well as on the national team. He is World champion from 2007 with the German national team. He participated on the German team that finished 4th at the 2008 European Men's Handball Championship."@en,
