ns20:cape_flats_uprising ns21:contactInformation "Office Tel. &amp; Fax. +27 (0)21 706_0481 healthehood {at} mweb {dot} co {dot} za " ;
    dct:description """South African [b]Cape Flats Uprising[/b] was created by activist and writer [a967489] as "an informal record, publishing and clothing label". 

It releases CDs, DVDs, books and magazines as part of the "Heal the Hood" initiative (itself founded in 1998) and is also a fundraising and social upliftment initiative for the youth of the so_called "Coloured" community living in the townships near Cape Town. The organisation has strong ties with Sweden where their CDs are distributed as well.
""" ;
    mo:discogs <http://www.discogs.com/label/Cape+Flats+Uprising> ;
    rdf1:type mo:Label ;
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <http://healthehood.org.za>,
        "http://www.facebook.com/discography/?id=48042893547" ;
    foaf:logo <http://api.discogs.com/image/L_110754_1275421038.jpeg> ;
    foaf:name "Cape Flats Uprising" .

