dbpedia:Jessie_Evans_\(singer\) dbo:abstract "Jessie Evans is an American born songwriter, singer, saxophonist, and record producer currently residing in Berlin, Germany. On stage, she is often accompanied by Iggy Pop's drummer, Toby Dammit. Her first solo album Is it fire? was released on her label 'Fantomette Records' in November 2009. The sessions were recorded with drummer Budgie of bands Siouxsie and the Banshees and The Creatures. Evans' music is a sensual and exotic mix of three different genres : afro_beat, pop and electro. In 2011, she will be on tour in Europe from May til July with concerts announced in Austria, Germany, Slovakia and in France."@en,
        "Jessie Evans est une chanteuse et saxophoniste américaine venue du punk. Elle joue désormais une musique aux confins de plusieurs genres : de l'afro_beat avec un soupçon de pop et d'électronique."@fr ;
