dbpedia:Aline_Mayrisch_de_Saint_Hubert dbo:abstract "Aline Mayrisch de Saint_Hubert (22 August 1874 – 20 January 1947), née Aline de Saint_Hubert, was a Luxembourgian women's rights campaigner, socialite, philanthropist. Mayrisch established many non_governmental organisations, and was President of the Luxembourg Red Cross. She married to Émile Mayrisch."@en,
