    dbpprop:imagesize 200 ;
    dbpprop:quote "(Marina Ladynina has never been the member of the Communist Party and kept her medals in a drawer, avoiding wearing them in public.)"^^rdf1:langString,
        "For the first time I was invited to Kremlin in 1939, after the release of Tractor Drivers. Somebody approached me. 'It is your first time here with us!' the man said, we clicked glasses and he passed by, accompanied by two men with trays. Some people were around me and I asked, too loudly perhaps: 'Who was it?' _ 'Hush, hush! Are you mad? This is Molotov!'\" …\"As for Stalin, I have never been introduced to him personally. I've read that he liked me. The feeling was not reciprocated. I hated him."^^rdf1:langString,
        "Ladynina in Kremlin"^^rdf1:langString ;
