dbpedia:Michael_Keating_\(political_scientist\) dbo:abstract "Michael Keating FRSE (born 2 February 1950) is a political scientist specialising in nationalism, European politics, regional politics and devolution. He is Professor of Scottish Politics at the University of Aberdeen. He is the Director of the ESRC Centre on Constitutional Change."@en ;
