dbpedia:Josh_Forbes dbo:abstract "Josh Forbes is an American music video director. He has directed videos for I Fight Dragons, The Fray, Sara Bareilles, Good Charlotte, Alkaline Trio, The Offspring, Metro Station (band), Coheed and Cambria, Sea Wolf, Barenaked Ladies, and Ingrid Michaelson, and Jenny Owen Youngs. Forbes is signed to More Media for music videos and The Joneses for commercials. He is the co_founder of his own production imprint Winch & Pulley."@en ;
