dbpedia:Apostolos_Kontos dbo:abstract "Apostolos Kontos (griechisch Απόστολος Κόντος; * 22. November 1949 in Griechenland) ist ein ehemaliger griechischer Basketballspieler und _trainer."@de,
        "Apostolos Kontos (Greek: Απόστολος Κόντος) (born on November 22, 1947) is a Greek former professional basketball player and coach. He is considered to be one of the great players in Panathinaikos Athens history. He was also a long_time member of the senior men's Greek national basketball team. He played at the small forward position."@en ;
