    dct:description "Independent netlabel Ground Floor Records was founded between summer / fall in 2005 by Tomáš Daňhel (Basementality) and Heretic. Label concerns about alternative music, mainly hip_hop and his abstract / experimental branches. Another styles in repertoire are trip_hop, downtempo, electronica, nu_jazz and alternative." ;
