dbpedia:Jorma_Etelälahti dbo:abstract "Jorma Kalevi Etelälahti  (* 17. November 1951 in Toivakka) ist ein ehemaliger finnischer Nordischer Kombinierer."@de,
        "Jorma Etelälahti (born 17 November 1951) is a Finnish former nordic combined skier. He earned a silver in the 3 x 10 km team event at the 1982 FIS Nordic World Ski Championships in Oslo."@en,
