dbpedia:Nehemiah_Eastman dbo:abstract "Nehemiah Eastman (* 16. Juni 1782 in Gilmanton, Belknap County, New Hampshire; † 11. Januar 1856 in Farmington, New Hampshire) war ein US_amerikanischer Politiker. Zwischen 1825 und 1827 vertrat er den Bundesstaat New Hampshire im US_Repräsentantenhaus."@de,
        "Nehemiah Eastman (June 16, 1782 – January 11, 1856) was an American lawyer, banker and politician from New Hampshire. He served as a member of the United States House of Representatives, the New Hampshire Senate and the New Hampshire House of Representatives in the early 1800s."@en ;
