dbpedia:Dorian_Bylykbashi ns70:height "180.0"^^ns69:centimetre ;
    dbo:abstract "Dorian Bylykbashi (born 8 August 1980 in Elbasan) is an Albanian footballer who currently plays for Partizani Tirana in the Albanian Superliga. He mainly plays as an attacking midfielder and he has previously played for KF Elbasani and Vllaznia Shkodër in Albania as well as Kryvbas Kryvyi Rih. He was in the Partizani squad that won the Albanian Cup and Albanian Supercup in the 2003–04 season."@en,
        "Dorian Bylykbashi est un footballeur albanais né le 8 août 1980 à Elbasan. Il joue actuellement au KS Elbasani."@fr,
        "Dorian Bylykbashi (ur. 8 sierpnia 1980 w Elbasanie) – albański piłkarz występujący na pozycji napastnika."@pl,
        "Dorian Bylykbashi (Nascido a 8 de agosto de 1980, em Elbasan) é um jogador de futebol albanês que atua como atacante. Atualmente, joga pelo Partizani Tirana."@pt,
        "Дориан Бюлюкбаши (алб. Dorian Bylykbashi; 8 августа 1980, Эльбасан, Албания) — албанский футболист, полузащитник клуба «Партизани» и сборной Албании."@ru ;
