dbpedia:Katja_Flint dbo:abstract "Katja Flint (* 11. November 1959 in Stadthagen, Niedersachsen) ist eine deutsche Schauspielerin."@de,
        "Katja Flint (born 11 November 1959 in Stadthagen, Lower Saxony) is a German actress. Flint grew up in Utah and married German actor Heiner Lauterbach. They have a son named Oskar. Since 1982 Flint has been a major character in German movies and on German television.She was in long_term relationships with Bernd Eichinger a German film_producer in the 1990s and Peter Handke an Austrian author on the early 2000s."@en,
