dbpedia:Ashok_Gaikwad dbo:abstract "Ashok Gaikwad is an Indian film director who has directed several feature films. His first notable film was Qatil (1988) starring Aditya Pancholi and Sangeeta Bijlani. He was prominent in the 1990s with many Mithun Chakraborty and Jackie Shroff starrers. Some of his films are Phool Aur Angaar, Izzat, Police Officer and Krishan Avtaar."@en,
        "Ashok Gaikwad es un director de cine indio que tiene una amplia fimografía. Su primera película notable fue Qatil (1988), protagonizada por Aditya Pancholi y Sangeeta Bijlani. Su trabajo destacó en la década de 1990 junto al de otros directores tales como Mithun Chakraborty y Jackie Shroff . Algunas de sus películas son Phool Aur Angaar, Izzat, Police Officer y Krishan Avtaar."@es ;
