    rdfs1:comment "José Guízar Morfín (* 12. Februar 1906 in Guadalajara, Jalisco; † 27. September 1980 in Mexiko_Stadt), besser bekannt als Pepe Guízar, war ein mexikanischer Komponist."@de,
        "José Guízar Morfín, better known as Pepe Guízar (February 12, 1906 – 27 September 1980), was a Mexican composer, poet and musician. He composed the song \"Guadalajara\", a popular mariachi song. His tune, \"A Poco No\", can be heard in the 1941 film, Citizen Kane."@en,
        "Pepe Guízar fue un compositor mexicano de música popular. Es autor de canciones rancheras, sones jaliscienses y boleros."@es ;
    rdfs1:label "Pepe Guízar"@de,
