dbpedia:Ashima_Bhalla dbo:abstract "Ashima Bhallla is an Indian actress who has appeared in Hindi, Kannada, Tamil, Telugu and Assamese language films. Bhalla made her debut with Pyaar Zindagi Hai film starring Mohnish Bahl and Rajesh Khanna.. She also went on to appear on television, portraying the lead role in the Indian soap Meri Awaz Ko Mil Gayi Roshni on Star Plus. Furthermore, she also participated in the show Ek Khiladi Ek Haseena alongside Irfan Pathan."@en ;
