dbpedia:Doreen_Montgomery dbo:abstract "Doreen Montgomery (12 April 1913, Glasgow – 24 February 1992, London) was a British screenwriter. Working for Gainsborough Pictures, her early credits include Just William (1940), The Man in Grey (1943), Fanny by Gaslight (1944) and While I Live (1947). Television credits include Dr. Finlay's Casebook and The Avengers (for which she created the character of Emma Peel). Date of Death 24 February 1992, London, England, UK"@en,
        " Pour les articles homonymes, voir Montgomery. Doreen Montgomery est une scénariste britannique née en 1916 et décédée en 1992."@fr ;
