    rdfs1:comment "Jo Hee_bong (born August 23, 1971) is a South Korean actor. Jo began his acting career in 1997 as part of the theatre troupe Bipa (비파). He later became known as a supporting actor onscreen, in films such as Blind (2011) and Incomplete Life: Prequel (2013), and the television dramas Hong Gil_dong (2008), Joseon X_Files (2010), and Good Doctor (2013)."@en,
