ns20:sub_conscious_communications ns21:contactInformation "10061 riverside drive #759 toluca lake california 91602 united states cEvin key: ckey@sbcglobal.net phil western: musicatdhsound@gmail.com omar torres: random23@mindspring.com brian 'eEL' albright: eel@darkbraindesign.com " ;
    dct:description """subcon is a california based records label | musician collective | remix team | 32_track digital studio | analogue synthesizer collection.

originally established as subconscious records in vancouver, 1993 by skinny puppy keyboardist dwayne goettel and download/off and gone keyboardist phil western _ for the release of a limited edition 12" single by his solo techno project aDuck, with western on the b side as phylth. it was revived and slightly renamed in 1995 by goettel and his skinny puppy bandmate cEvin key, for the release of material by their new project dOWNLOAD.

following goettels' death in august of that year, key continued the operations of subconscious along with anthony valcic, phil western, and an extended crew of collaborators and friends that have included: ken marshall, ryan moore, and mark spybey.
""" ;
    mo:discogs <http://www.discogs.com/label/Sub_Conscious+Communications> ;
    rdf1:type mo:Label ;
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <http://www.subconsciousrecords.com>,
        <http://www.subconsciousstudios.com> ;
    foaf:logo <http://api.discogs.com/image/L_2567_001.jpg>,
        <http://api.discogs.com/image/L_2567_1257360207.jpeg> ;
    foaf:name "Sub_Conscious Communications" .

dbpedia:Jano_Ananidze ns70:height "173.0"^^ns69:centimetre ;
    dbo:abstract "Dschano Ananidse (georgisch ჯანო ანანიძე, englische Transkription: Jano Ananidze; russisch Жано Ананидзе; * 10. Oktober 1992 in Kobuleti) ist ein georgischer Fußballspieler, der derzeit bei Spartak Moskau unter Vertrag steht."@de,
        "Jano Ananidze (Georgian: ჯანო ანანიძე; born 10 October 1992 in Kobuleti) is a Georgian professional footballer who plays as an attacking midfielder for Spartak Moscow in the Russian Premier League."@en,
        "Jano Ananidze (en georgiano: ჯანო ანანიძე; nacido el 10 de octubre de 1992 en Kobuleti) es un futbolista georgiano que juega actualmente en el FC Spartak Moscú de la Liga Premier de Rusia."@es,
        "Jano Ananidze, né le 10 octobre 1992 à Kobuleti en Georgie, est un footballeur international georgien qui évolue au Spartak Moscou."@fr,
        "ジャノ・アナニーゼ（グルジア語: ჯანო ანანიძე、英語: Jano Ananidze、1992年10月10日 _ ）は、ジョージア・ コブレチ出身の同国代表サッカー選手。FCスパルタク・モスクワ所属。ポジションは攻撃的MF。繊細なボールタッチとパスセンスを持ち味とするジョージア期待の選手で、サイドでもプレーできる。"@ja,
        "Jano Ananidze (Georgisch: ჯანო ანანიძე) (Koboeleti, 10 oktober 1992) is een Georgisch voetballer die bij voorkeur als middenvelder speelt. Hij stroomde in 2009 door vanuit de jeugd van Spartak Moskou. Hij debuteerde in 2009 in het Georgisch nationaal elftal."@nl,
        "Dżano Ananidze (gruz. ჯანო ანანიძე, ur. 10 października 1992 w Kobuleti) – piłkarz gruziński grający na pozycji lewego pomocnika. Mierzy 170 cm wzrostu, waży 60 kg. Od 2009 roku jest zawodnikiem klubu Spartak Moskwa."@pl,
        "Zhano Ananidze (Kobuleti, 12 de outubro de 1992) é um futebolista profissional georgiano, atacante, milita no Spartak Moscovo."@pt,
        "Джано́ Амира́нович Анани́дзе (груз. ჯანო ამირანის ძე ანანიძე; 10 октября 1992 года, Кобулети, Грузия) — грузинский футболист грузино_русского происхождения, полузащитник московского «Спартака» Игрок национальной сборной Грузии."@ru ;
